  "description": "\"They said if I just give birth to one kid, they’ll set me free, right?\"    \n\nTwenty-year-old Sion, the daughter of a National Assembly member, is dragged away by loan shark Han Ki-seok to bear his child due to her parents' debt. \n\n\"Wouldn't it be better to die than to carry a thug's baby?\" \n\nWhen they first met, he was a cruel and cold man. \n\nHowever, \"Eat your meals. That's why you're so skinny.\" \"Stay by my side. That's the only way you'll be safe.\" \n\nAmidst his relentless control, Ki-seok's hidden tenderness begins to surface, and Sion's fear and confusion slowly turn into an intense attraction.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14384295)",
